の服装でお願いします。\n\nお忙しいところ恐れ入りますが検討宜しくお願いいたします。\n\nしゃん\n\nhttps://www.dropbox.com/scl/fo/larjbx5zs4cujqtxk6cik/AFOwNsulbAvJvzeSqSaMJSw?rlkey=108v9y5j8h1y78g46t6stg46h&st=n0ny35v9&dl=0", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@EpatrNJtip/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/259a5f94/uploads/origins/de481eb7-2f01-467f-8cb7-af587ee8fba6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e124baba974e213fd059c0b412d5c07", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/259a5f94/uploads/origins/de481eb7-2f01-467f-8cb7-af587ee8fba6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e124baba974e213fd059c0b412d5c07, https://si.imgix.net/259a5f94/uploads/origins/de481eb7-2f01-467f-8cb7-af587ee8fba6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76f3b6040757c8cf1a4e2c9c47af0c0a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/259a5f94/uploads/origins/de481eb7-2f01-467f-8cb7-af587ee8fba6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5990bd379e88440f8841b05a08fcbc80 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "お付き合い中の鴫啓で街中デートお願いします！！\n季節は春〜初夏辺りで！\nおてて繋いでると嬉しいです！！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@EpatrNJtip/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7c5b2ca5/uploads/origins/45d8d097-caea-4320-b947-3e62a2ceb30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b72275920c7a82281070d01cd8aa07ed", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7c5b2ca5/uploads/origins/45d8d097-caea-4320-b947-3e62a2ceb30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b72275920c7a82281070d01cd8aa07ed, https://si.imgix.net/7c5b2ca5/uploads/origins/45d8d097-caea-4320-b947-3e62a2ceb30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ca4ff34246d7fe5b8b1e73387f86845 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7c5b2ca5/uploads/origins/45d8d097-caea-4320-b947-3e62a2ceb30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&c